    "message": "Improve existing instrument materials, piano tuning and expressive formants\n\nContinue the full 521-program refinement without adding preset identities. Give nine existing bell and plucked programs distinct resonant materials, stabilize piano string-course geometry, and retain fixed-Hz wind and plucked-body responses through live pitch changes.\n\nAppend two compatible material controls with old host ranges and session defaults preserved. Expand causal DSP, preset, state and inventory checks; retain the failed Mac AU GUI seed as an independent required validation lane. Extend audition coverage to 225 clips and update bundled guides for library revision 2026.11.6.",
